    "title": "Check Whether a Binary Tree is Complete",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given the root of a binary tree, determine whether it is a complete binary tree. Every level except possibly the last must be completely filled, and all nodes of the last level must be as far left as possible.",
